 body={"output":"Sure! Start with a solid warm‑up (jog, dynamic stretches). Practice a strong, straight jump and a tucked “pike” position on a soft mat or gymnastics floor. Use a spotter or a crash mat for safety, and work on your core and leg strength with squats and planks. Once you’re comfortable, try a low‑height back‑flip with a coach’s guidance. Let me know if you’d like recommendations for local classes or gear!"}
